# Blog Rules (Manas Setu)

## Content source
- Blog posts live in `content/blog/` as `.md` or `.mdx`.
- Slug = filename (kebab-case). Example: `exam-stress-basics.mdx` => `/blog/exam-stress-basics`.

## Required frontmatter
Every post must include:
- `title`: string
- `description`: string
- `date`: "YYYY-MM-DD"
- `author`: string
- `tags`: string[]
- `lang`: "en" | "ne"
- `draft`: boolean (optional)

## Behavior
- Draft posts are **hidden in production** builds.
- Blog list supports:
  - filtering by tag
  - search by title/description
- Post pages include:
  - table of contents (optional, if easy)
  - “Back to blog”
  - related posts (optional)